#: tycontrols.strconsts.rstygraphiccontrolonform
#, object-pascal-format
msgid ""
"The graphic control \"%s\" was placed directly on the form.\n"
"Windowless (graphic) controls paint onto the form itself and will be HIDDEN behind the \n"
"content area. Move it into the Surface content container so it stays visible."
msgstr ""
"图形控件 \"%s\" 被直接放在了窗体上。\n"
"无窗口的图形控件绘制在窗体自身上,会被内容区遮挡而看不见。\n"
"请把它移进 Surface 内容容器,它才会显示。"

#: tycontrols.strconsts.rstysurfacepurpose
msgid "TTyForm content host — click for details"
msgstr "TTyForm 内容宿主 —— 点击查看说明"

#: tycontrols.strconsts.rstysurfacedeleted
msgid ""
"You just deleted the form's content host (Surface) — and with it every control it hosted.\n"
"\n"
"Press Ctrl+Z to undo.\n"
"\n"
"If undo does not restore it, close this form WITHOUT saving and reopen it — the Surface is not on the component palette, so it cannot be dropped back."
msgstr ""
"你刚刚删除了窗体的内容宿主(Surface)—— 它承载的所有控件也随之一起被删除了。\n"
"\n"
"请按 Ctrl+Z 撤销。\n"
"\n"
"如果撤销没能恢复,请不要保存、直接关闭这个窗体再重新打开 —— Surface 不在组件面板上,拖不回来。"

